        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Olga Pershankova, Nikolai Morozov, Tatiana Navka\n- Places: Azerbaijan, Belarus\n- Roles: figure skaters, coach, choreographer, ice dancer\n- Events: 1998 Winter Olympics, 1998 World Championships\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, Nikolai Morozov and Tatiana Navka competed for Belarus in ice dancing at the 1998 Winter Olympics and placed 16th.\n- In 1998, Nikolai Morozov and Tatiana Navka competed for Belarus at the 1998 World Championships and placed 10th.\n- Nikolai Alexandrovich Morozov, born on 17 December 1975, is a Russian figure skating coach and choreographer.\n- Nikolai Morozov is a former competitive ice dancer.\n- The season after the referenced one, Olga Pershankova teamed up with Nikolai Morozov to compete for Azerbaijan.",
